hadiths[26]{hadithnumber,text}:
"166","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Sannah (R.A) se riwayat hai ke unhone Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Islam ghareeb shuru hua phir waisa hi ghareeb hoga jaisa shuru hua, pas ghareebon ke liye tooba hai."" Pucha gaya: Ya Rasool Allah! Ghareeb kaun hain? Farmaya: ""Wo log theek karte hain jab log kharab hon, aur jis ki jaan uske haath mein hai, Eeman Madinah ki taraf is tarah jama hoga jaise sail jama hota hai, aur jis ki jaan uske haath mein hai, Islam do masjid ke darmiyan is tarah lotega jaise janwar apne khule mein lotati hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 16810)"
"167","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (R.A) se riwayat hai Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) se: ""Din ghareeb shuru hua aur ghareeb hoga jaisa shuru hua, pas ghareeb logon ke liye tooba hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 9042)"
"168","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud (R.A) se riwayat hai Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) se (alfaz ke sath): ""Islam..."" phir unhone iski misl zikr ki aur izafa kiya, aur pucha gaya: ""Aur ghuraba kaun hain?"" Farmaya: ""Qabail se nikle hue."" (Musnad Ahmad: 3784)"
"169","[AI-translation] Alqamah Muzani se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Ek shakhs ne mujhe hadith sunai, unka kehna tha: Main Umar bin Al-Khattab ke majlis mein Madinah mein tha, pas unhon ne qaum ke ek shakhs se kaha: ""Aye fulan! Tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ko Islam ki kaisi sifat karte hue suna hai?"" Kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Islam jadh'a (jawan) shuru hua, phir thani, phir raba'i, phir sudasi, phir bazil (dant tod) hua."" Umar ne kaha: ""Bazul ke baad sirf kami hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 15895)"
"170","[AI-translation] Kurz bin Alqamah Khuza'i (R.A) se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Ek a'rabi ne kaha: ""Ya Rasool Allah! Kya Islam ke liye koi muntaha hai?"" Farmaya: ""Haan, Arab ya Ajam ke kisi ghar ke ahal jisse Allah Azzawajall khair chahega, Islam un par daakhil karega."" Kaha: ""Phir kya? Ya Rasool Allah!"" Farmaya: ""Phir fitne utrenga jaise saye."" A'rabi ne kaha: ""Kabhi nahi, (Ek riwayat mein: Kabhi nahi, Allah ki qasam agar Allah chaahe!)"" Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bilkul, jis ki jaan uske haath mein hai, tum us mein asawid-e-subban (siah sageer) ban kar lotoge, tum mein se ek dusre ki gardan kaatenge."" (Musnad Ahmad: 16012)"
"171","[AI-translation] (Aur unse dusre tareeqe se nawah-e-is ki riwayat hai). Is mein farmood-e- ""Tum mein se ek dusre ki gardan kaatenge"" ke baad Sufyan ko parh kar sunaya: Zuhri ne kaha: Asawid-e-subban, Sufyan ne kaha: Siyah hayat (kale saanp) nasabba (uthna), yani buland hota hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 16012)"
"172","[AI-translation] (Aur unse tisey tareeqe se nawah-e-is ki riwayat hai). Aur izafa farmaya, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Aur us din behtareen insan wo mumin hai jo pahaar ke kisi ghaat mein alehda ho, apne Rubb Tabarak wa Ta'ala ka taqwa kare aur logon ko apne shar se chhod de."" (Musnad Ahmad: 16014)"
"173","[AI-translation] Haddasana Walid bin Muslim, haddasani Abd-ul-Aziz bin Ismail bin Ubaidullah ke Sulaiman bin Habib ne unhe hadith sunai Abu Umamah Bahili (R.A) se Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) farmate hain: ""Islam ki baandhein aik ke baad aik todi jayengi, pas jab bhi aik baandh tootegi log agle se chimut jayenge, aur un mein se sab se pehle tootne wali hukm (hakoomat) hogi aur aakhir wali namaz hogi."" (21143)"
"174","[AI-translation] Ibn Fayruz Dailami apne waalid (R.A) se riwayat karte hain ke unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Islam aik ke baad aik khand (baandh) se tootta jayega jaise rassi aik ke baad aik taur (morri) se toot-ti hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 18202)"
"175","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Busr (R.A) se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Maine kafi arsa pehle ek hadith suni thi: ""Jab tum kisi qaum mein bees mard ya is se kam ya zyada ho, aur tum unke chehron ko dekho to tumhein un mein aisa koi shakhs na mile jisse Allah ki khauf ki jaye, to samajh lo ke waqe amr patla (kamzor) ho chuka hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 17831)"
"176","[AI-translation] Hudhaifah bin Al-Yamān raziyallāhu 'anhu farmāte hain: Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne hamein do hadīthein bīyān farmāīn, jin mein se ek ko main dekh chukā hoon aur doosre kā main muntazir hoon. Unhon ne hamein bāyān farmāyā ke amānat logon ke dilon ki jarr mein utāri gayī, phir Qur'ān nazīl huā, to Qur'ān se 'ilm sīkho aur Sunnat se 'ilm sīkho. Phir unhon ne amānat ke uthāe jāne kā zikr farmāyā aur kahā: Aadmi so jātā hai to amānat uske dil se qabz ho jātī hai, phir uskā asar aisā reh jātā hai jaise kisi dāgh kā asar, phir amānat uske dil se qabz ho jātī hai to uskā asar aisā reh jātā hai jaise aṅgār ko ragṛne kā, agar tum apne pāon par aṅgār ragṛo to use ubharā huā pāo, jabke us mein kuch na ho. Unhon ne phir ek kaṅkṛā uthāyā aur use apne pāon par ragṛā, aur farmāyā: Phir log āpas mein baya'a (lēn-dēn) karte hain, koi shakhs adā-e-amānat ke qarīb nahi hotā, yahāṁ tak ke kahā jāe: Be-fulān mein to ek amin mard hai. Yahāṁ tak ke kisi mard ke baare mein kahā jāe: Wah kaisā bahādur, kaisā ḥasīn aur kaisā 'āqil hai, hālānke uske dil mein sarḳah ke dāne ke barābar bhī īmān nahi. Aur mujhe ek waqt ā chukā hai, mujhe parwā nahi thī ke tum mein se kisse bai'at karūn, agar woh musalmān hai to uskā dīn use mujhe adā kar degā, aur agar woh naṣrānī ya yahūdī hai to uskā sā'is use mujhe adā kar degā. Magar āj ke din to main tum mein se sirf fulān aur fulān se bai'at kar saktā hoon. (Musnad Ahmad: 23644)"
"177","[AI-translation] Abdullāh (yani Ibn Mas'ūd raziyallāhu 'anhu) Nabī sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam se riwāyat karte hain, āpa sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Islam kī chakkī pāṁch (aur ek rīwāyat mein: pāṁch ke muqām par) aur tīs, yā chhah aur tīs, yā sāt aur tīs par ghūmtī hai. Agar woh halkān ho jāe to un logon kā maslak ho-gā jo guzar chuke, aur agar un kā dīn qā'im rahā to un ke liye sattar sāl qā'im rahēgā. Pūchā: Kiyā yeh jo guzarā yā jo bāqī? Farmāyā: Jo bāqī. (Musnad Ahmad: 3730)"
"178","[AI-translation] (Aur un se dūsrī sānad se bhi) Nabī sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam se is jaisī hadīth hai, albattā is mein yeh hai ke 'Umar raziyallāhu 'anhu ne kihā: Yā Rasūlallāh! Kiyā yeh māḍī hai yā bāqī? (Musnad Ahmad), (Doosri sānad) Isī tarāh ki hadīth hai, albattā is mein hai: Sayyadnā 'Umar raziyallāhu 'anhu ne kihā: Aye Allāh ke Rasūl! Māḍī mustaqil yā mustaqil itnā 'arṣah hai,,, 178 179, (179) (Aur un se tīsrī sānad se bhi) Farmāyā: Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Islam kī chakkī pāṁch aur tīs, yā chhah aur tīs, yā sāt aur tīs par zaul hogī, agar woh hēl gaye to jaise hēl chukon kā maslak, aur agar un kā dīn qā'im rahā to un ke liye sattar sāl qā'im rahēgā. 'Umar ne kihā: Yā Rasūlallāh! Kiyā jo guzarā yā jo bāqī? Farmāyā: Balkay jo bāqī. (Musnad Ahmad: 3707)"
"179","[AI-translation] (Aur un se tīsrī sānad se bhi) Farmāyā: Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Islam kī chakkī pāṁch aur tīs, yā chhah aur tīs, yā sāt aur tīs par zaul hogī, agar woh hēl gaye to jaise hēl chukon kā maslak, aur agar un kā dīn qā'im rahā to un ke liye sattar sāl qā'im rahēgā. 'Umar ne kihā: Yā Rasūlallāh! Kiyā jo guzarā yā jo bāqī? Farmāyā: Balkay jo bāqī. (Musnad Ahmad: 3707)"
"181","[AI-translation] Aur un se bhi riwāyat hai, unhon ne kihā: Maine Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ko farmāte huē sūnā: Allāh 'azza wa jall ne apnī makhlooq ko zulumāt mein paidā kiyā, phir us dīn un par apnā nūr phaṅkā, to jis ko us dīn Allāh kā nūr puṅchā woh hidāyat pā gayā aur jis se woh chhūṭ gayā woh ghumrāh ho gayā. Is liye main kahnā hoon: Qalam Allāh 'azza wa jall ke 'ilm ke muqām par sukhā (mukammal ho) chukā hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 6644)"
"182","[AI-translation] Ṭā'us bin Al-Yamānī se riwāyat hai, unhon ne kihā: Maine Nabī sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ke kuch ṣaḥābah ko pāyā jo keh rahe the: Har cheez taqdīr par hai. Unhon ne kihā: Aur maine Ibn 'Umar raziyallāhu 'anhu ko kihāte huē sūnā: Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Har cheez taqdīr par hai, yahāṁ tak keh 'ajz (kamzōrī) aur kais (hūshiyārī) bhī. (Musnad Ahmad: 5893)"
"183","[AI-translation] Abud Dardā raziyallāhu 'anhu Nabī sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam se riwāyat karte hain, āpa sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Allāh ne jab Ādam ko paidā kiyā to unke dāhine kandhe par mārā, to safed auvlād niklī jaise chiyṅṭiyān hōn, aur baen kandhe par mārā to kālī auvlād niklī jaise koyle hōn. Phir daheen wāle ko farmāyā: Jannat ki taraf, aur mujhe parwā nahi. Aur baen haath wāle ko farmāyā: Jahannam ki taraf, aur mujhe parwā nahi. (Musnad Ahmad: 28036)"
"184","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah raziyallāhu 'anhu Nabī sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam se riwāyat karte hain, āpa sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Mard barṣāt zamān tak ahl-e-Jannat ke a'māl kartā hai, phir Allāh uske liye ahl-e-Jahannam ke a'māl par mohr lagātā hai, to use ahl-e-Jahannam mein shāmil kardetā hai. Aur mard barṣāt zamān tak ahl-e-Jahannam ke a'māl kartā hai, phir Allāh uske liye ahl-e-Jannat ke a'māl par mohr lagātā hai, to use ahl-e-Jannat mein shāmil kardetā hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 10291)"
"185","[AI-translation] Anas bin Mālik raziyallāhu 'anhu se riwāyat hai ke Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Tumhein koi parwā nahi ke tum kisi par 'ajab na karo jab tak tum dekh nā lo ke uske liye kaise mohr lagāī jātī hai. Amal karne wālā apni 'umr kā lamhā zamān yā daur kā ek ḥissā nēk amal kartā hai, agar waisē hi mar jāe to Jannat mein jāega, phir rūbahrūb ho kar būrā amal karne lagtā hai. Aur bande daur kā ek ḥissā būrā amal kartā hai, agar waisē hi mar jāe to Jahannam mein jāega, phir rūbahrūb ho kar nēk amal karne lagtā hai. Aur jab Allāh kisi bande kā bhulā chahta hai to use uske maut se pahle amal mein lātā hai. Pūchā gayā: Yā Rasūlallāh! Woh kaise amal mein lātā hai? Farmāyā: Use nēk amal kī tawfīq detā hai, phir usi hālat par usay qabz karletā hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 12238)"
"186","[AI-translation] 'Ā'ishah raziyallāhu 'anhā se riwāyat hai ke Rasūlullāh sallallāhu 'alaihi wa ālihi wa sallam ne farmāyā: Mard ahl-e-Jannat ke a'māl kartā hai, hālānke woh ahl-e-Jahannam mein likhā huā hai. Phir jab uske maut se pahle ho to rūbahrūb ho jātā hai aur ahl-e-Jahannam ke amal kartā hai, to marta hai aur Jahannam mein dakhil hotā hai. Aur mard ahl-e-Jahannam ke a'māl kartā hai, hālānke woh kitāb mein ahl-e-Jannat mein likhā huā hai. Phir jab uske maut se pahle ho to rūbahrūb ho jātā hai aur ahl-e-Jannat ke amal kartā hai, to marta hai aur Jannat mein dakhil hotā hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 25269)"
"187","[AI-translation] Abi Nadrah kehte hain: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke ek sahabi bemar padhe. Un ke sahabib un se mulaqat ke liye dakhil hue toh woh ro diye. Un se poocha gaya: Kya tumhein rulata hai Abdullah? Kya tumhein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne nahi farmaya tha: Apni moonch kaat lo phir aise hi rehna jab tak mujh se mulaqat na karo? Unhon ne kaha: Bilkul, lekin main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna hai: ""Allah tabarak wa ta'ala ne apne daheen hath se ek muththi bandi aur farmaya: Yeh iske liye hai aur mujhe koi parwah nahi. Aur doosri muththi bandi, yani apne doosre hath se, aur farmaya: Yeh iske liye hai aur mujhe koi parwah nahi."" Pas mujhe nahi maloom ke main dono muththiyon mein se kis mein hoon. (Musnad Ahmad: 17737)"
"188","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) se is ki tarah marwi hai aur us mein hai: ""Pas unhon ne apne dono hatho se do muththiyan bandin aur farmaya: Yeh Jannat mein hai aur mujhe koi parwah nahi, aur yeh Nar mein hai aur mujhe koi parwah nahi."" (Musnad Ahmad: 22427)"
"189","[AI-translation] Ibn-e-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main ne Lamam se zyada milti-julti koi cheez nahi dekhi jaisa ke Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) se riwayat ki hai: ""Allah Azzawajall ne Ibn-e-Adam par uska zina ka hissa likh diya hai, woh la-mahal use pahunchega. Aur ankh ka zina dekhna hai, aur zaban ka zina bolna hai, aur nafs tamanna karti aur khwahish karti hai, aur farj use tasdeeq ya takzeeb karta hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 7705)"
"190","[AI-translation] Abdullah ne hamein hadith bayan ki, mere abba ne mujhe hadith bayan ki, Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein hadith bayan ki, az-Zuhri se, Ibn-e-Abi Khuzamah se apne walid se. Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aur Sufyan ne ek marra kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) se poocha: Aap batayein, koi dawa jis se hum ilaaj karein, aur koi ruqyah jis se hum ruqyah karein, aur koi taqa (parhez) jis ki hum parhez karein, kya yeh Allah ke qadr se koi cheez rok deti hain? Unhon ne farmaya: ""Be-shak yeh Allah tabarak wa ta'ala ke qadr mein se hain."" (Musnad Ahmad: 15551)"
"191","[AI-translation] Ibn-e-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek din woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke pichhe sawar hue toh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: ""Aye ghulam! Main tumhein kuch kalimaat sikhata hoon (Allah tumhein un se nafa de): Allah ki hifazat karo, woh tumhari hifazat karenge. Allah ki hifazat karo, tumhein unhe apne aage payoge. Aur jab poocho toh Allah se poocho, aur jab madad chaho toh Allah se madad chaho. Aur jaan lo ke agar saari ummat yeh ikhtiyar kar le ke tumhein nafa pahunchaye toh woh tumhein nafa nahi pahuncha sakti magar us cheez se jo Allah ne tumhare liye likh di ho. Aur agar yeh ikhtiyar kar lein ke tumhein nuqsan pahunchayein toh tumhein nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakti magar us cheez se jo Allah ne tumhare upar likh di ho. Qalam utha liye gaye aur safhay khushk ho gaye."" (Musnad Ahmad: 2669)"
"192","[AI-translation] (Aur un se doosri tareeqe se bhi marwi hai): Is ki tarah aur us mein izafah hai: ""Rakhai mein Allah ko pehchano, woh shiddat mein tumhein pehchanenge."" (Aur us mein yeh bhi hai): ""Pas agar saari makhluq sab ikatthi ho kar yeh chahain ke tumhein kisi cheez se nafa pahunchayein jo Allah ne tumhare upar nahi likha toh woh us par qaadir nahi hongi, aur agar yeh chahain ke tumhein kisi cheez se nuqsan pahunchayein jo Allah ne tumhare upar nahi likha toh woh us par qaadir nahi hongi. Aur jaan lo ke tumhein na-pasand cheez par sabr karne mein bohot khair hai, aur nusrat sabr ke saath hai, aur faraj kurb ke saath hai, aur ke mushkil ke saath aasani hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 2803)"
